  <div class="doc-content prose prose-invert max-w-none">
    ---<br>title: Provider Adapter 開發指南<br>description: 如何為新的 Minecraft 託管商開發 Adapter<br>---<br><h1>Provider Adapter 開發指南</h1><br><h2>Adapter 介面</h2><br><br>所有 Adapter 必須實作 <code>shared/src/providers/adapter.ts</code> 中定義的 <code>ProviderAdapter</code> 介面：<br><br>``<code>typescript<br>interface ProviderAdapter {<br>  info: ProviderAdapterInfo;<br><br>  testConnection(apiKey: string): Promise&lt;ConnectionTestResult&gt;;<br>  listServers(apiKey: string): Promise&lt;ServerListItem[]&gt;;<br>  getServerStatus(apiKey: string, serverExternalId: string): Promise&lt;...&gt;;<br>  powerAction(apiKey: string, serverExternalId: string, action: 'start' | 'stop' | 'restart'): Promise&lt;boolean&gt;;<br>  sendConsoleCommand(apiKey: string, serverExternalId: string, command: string): Promise&lt;{ executed: boolean }&gt;;<br>  getConsoleOutput(apiKey: string, serverExternalId: string, lines?: number): Promise&lt;string[]&gt;;<br>  connectConsoleStream(apiKey, serverExternalId, onMessage, onError): Promise&lt;() =&gt; void&gt;;<br>  listFiles(apiKey: string, serverExternalId: string, path: string): Promise&lt;FileListItem[]&gt;;<br>  readFile(apiKey: string, serverExternalId: string, path: string): Promise&lt;string&gt;;<br>  writeFile(apiKey: string, serverExternalId: string, path: string, content: string, overwrite?: boolean): Promise&lt;void&gt;;<br>  deleteFile(apiKey: string, serverExternalId: string, path: string): Promise&lt;void&gt;;<br>  uploadFile(apiKey: string, serverExternalId: string, path: string, content: string, encoding?: 'utf-8' | 'base64'): Promise&lt;void&gt;;<br>  downloadFile(apiKey: string, serverExternalId: string, path: string): Promise&lt;string&gt;;<br>  createBackup(apiKey: string, serverExternalId: string, name?: string): Promise&lt;{ id: string; name: string }&gt;;<br>  listBackups(apiKey: string, serverExternalId: string): Promise&lt;Array&lt;{ id: string; name: string; createdAt: string; size?: number }&gt;&gt;;<br>  deleteBackup(apiKey: string, serverExternalId: string, backupId: string): Promise&lt;void&gt;;<br>  getCapabilities(apiKey: string): Promise&lt;ProviderCapabilities&gt;;<br>}<br></code>`<code><br><h2>能力回報格式</h2><br><br>每個能力必須獨立回報：<br><br>| 值 | 說明 |<br>|-----|------|<br>| </code>supported<code> | 已驗證支援 |<br>| </code>unsupported<code> | 明確不支援 |<br>| </code>permission_denied<code> | 需要更高權限 |<br>| </code>not_configured<code> | 尚未配置 |<br>| </code>temporarily_unavailable<code> | 暫時不可用 |<br><h2>開發步驟</h2><br><h3>1. 建立 Adapter 檔案</h3><br><br></code>`<code>typescript<br>// panel/src/worker/adapters/CustomAdapter.ts<br>import type { ProviderAdapter, ... } from '@origessentials/shared';<br><br>export class CustomAdapter implements ProviderAdapter {<br>  info: ProviderAdapterInfo = {<br>    id: 'custom',<br>    name: 'Custom Hosting',<br>    baseUrl: '',<br>    authMethod: 'api_key',<br>  };<br><br>  async testConnection(apiKey: string) {<br>    // 實作連線測試<br>  }<br><br>  // ... 實作其他方法<br>}<br></code>`<code><br><h3>2. 註冊 Adapter</h3><br><br></code>`<code>typescript<br>// panel/src/worker/adapters/index.ts<br>import { CaforaHostAdapter } from './CaforaHostAdapter';<br>import { CustomAdapter } from './CustomAdapter';<br><br>export const adapterRegistry: Record&lt;string, ProviderAdapter&gt; = {<br>  cafora_host: new CaforaHostAdapter(),<br>  custom: new CustomAdapter(),<br>};<br></code>`<code><br><h3>3. 實作單元測試</h3><br><br></code>`<code>typescript<br>// panel/tests/adapters/CustomAdapter.test.ts<br>import { describe, it, expect } from 'vitest';<br>import { CustomAdapter } from '../../src/worker/adapters/CustomAdapter';<br><br>describe('CustomAdapter', () =&gt; {<br>  it('should test connection', async () =&gt; {<br>    const adapter = new CustomAdapter();<br>    const result = await adapter.testConnection('test-key');<br>    expect(result.success).toBe(true);<br>  });<br>});<br></code>``<br><h2>注意事項</h2><br><br>1. <strong>不捏造 API</strong>：未驗證的端點不得宣稱支援<br>2. <strong>安全優先</strong>：所有憑證加密後存入 D1<br>3. <strong>錯誤具體</strong>：錯誤訊息需指出具體問題，不得洩漏秘密<br>4. <strong>速率限制</strong>：適度處理 429 響應，使用指數退避
  </div>
</template>
